{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3606883","formula":"K₂Ca[(UO₂)₃O₃(OH)₂]₂·5H₂O","hill":"CaH14K2O27U6","elements":["H","O","K","Ca","U"],"composition":{"H":14.0,"K":2.0,"O":27.0,"U":6.0,"Ca":1.0},"names":{"en":"Agrinierite","ru":"Агриньерит","uk":"Агріньєрит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Agrinierite is a mineral often found in the oxidation zone of uranium deposits. It is named after Henry Agrinier (1928–1971), a French engineer for the Commissariat à l'Énergie Atomique (Mineralogy Laboratory of the French Atomic Energy Commission, Paris, France). Agrinierite is a hydrated oxide of uranium discovered during the exploitation of the uranium deposit of Margnac (Haute-Vienne, France), the only site in the world where it is known today.","ru":"Агриньери́т (англ. Agrinierite) — очень редкий урановый минерал, относящийся к классу оксидов. Химическая формула: K2Ca(UO2)6O6(OH)4·5H2O. Найден только на урановом месторождении Margnac Mine во Франции.","uk":"Агриньєрит — це дуже рідкісний урановий мінерал класу оксидів. Уперше знайдений у 1971 році на урановому родовищі Margnac Mine у Франції. На сьогоднішній день зустрічається тільки у цьому місці."},"fame":12,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3606883","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agrinierite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%8C%D1%94%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"pho